WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.724
- What's your go-to in the
city, when people come?

00:00:01.724 --> 00:00:06.724
- My wife and I, we go near
Santa Monica in the west side.

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:10.258
There's a Sawtelle Japantown,
there's a Sawtelle District,

00:00:10.258 --> 00:00:11.091
- [Kelly Clarkson] Oh!

00:00:11.091 --> 00:00:13.173
where there's a lot of
Asian-American cuisine.

00:00:15.039 --> 00:00:15.872
And it's not only

00:00:15.872 --> 00:00:18.330
Japanese cuisine, Korean
cuisine, Chinese food, the boba-

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:19.410
- Wait, where is this?

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:22.200
- It's on Sawtelle, it's
called the Sawtelle District.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.750
If you even Google it, or go on YouTube,

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.569
it's Sawtelle Japantown.

00:00:26.569 --> 00:00:27.402
- Okay.

00:00:27.402 --> 00:00:28.980
- But it's Asian American
cuisine everywhere.

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:32.610
And it is really amazing,
and I highly recommend it.

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:35.490
Doesn't get a lot of press
that a lot of people say,

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:37.950
but for me that's like my favorite

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:39.420
when I first moved out here.

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:41.160
And when I first got married to my hoe,

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.672
her last name, it's for true.

00:00:42.672 --> 00:00:44.010
(laughter)

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:49.010
So it's fine! I can say it!
Hoes pimping ain't easy!

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:51.410
(laughter)

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:56.040
- I love you so much. You're
gonna pay for that. (laughs)

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.260
- I'm gonna pay for that. (laughs)

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:03.180
And so we would go around
Sawtelle when we were dating

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:06.090
when we first got married
and it's just a lovely time

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:07.230
and I highly recommend that.

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:09.038
- I wanna go, I've never been!

00:01:09.038 --> 00:01:10.320
- You'd love it. You'd love it.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:11.320
- I would love it!

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:12.451
If you love any Asian-American cuisine,

00:01:12.451 --> 00:01:14.964
- I love Asian food, yep!
- Chinese, Korean, Japanese,

00:01:14.964 --> 00:01:16.800
and they have pastries
there, Beard Papa's.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:17.778
It's all these amazing.

00:01:17.778 --> 00:01:18.611
- [Kelly Clarkson] Wow!
- Yeah. It's so cool.

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:20.730
- See, people always think
that I've lived here for 20.

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:23.370
I haven't, I've been to
in Texas or Tennessee.

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:24.203
- [Ken Jeong] Right.

00:01:24.203 --> 00:01:25.036
This is the first I've
actually really lived here.

00:01:25.036 --> 00:01:25.869
- [Ken Jeong] Yeah.

00:01:25.869 --> 00:01:27.330
- So I'm new too, so I'm
learning the top three as well

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:28.880
and all these places stuff.
- No, Absolutely. Yeah.

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:31.620
- It's so good! But is it
true that you got to work

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:33.630
with one of your idols this
summer? That's awesome.

00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:38.630
