00:01:41.490 --> 00:01:46.490
Just literally one of my idols growing up.

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:50.100
And it literally just one
of the reasons why I got

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:51.480
into comedy in the first place.

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:54.510
And I'm sure you've had
this too, where every day

00:01:54.510 --> 00:01:56.160
on set was a pinch me moment.

00:01:56.160 --> 00:01:57.257
- Oh yeah!

00:01:57.257 --> 00:01:58.740
- Because he's literally
one of the reasons

00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:00.750
why I just wanted to get in a comedy

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:03.960
and just to work with
one of my heroes and just

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:07.080
I still have this, every day!

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:10.080
You just go into work, smiling,
and then you leave smiling.

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:10.920
And that's just,

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:11.753
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah!

00:02:11.753 --> 00:02:14.730
- If you have any job like
that in anything that you do,

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:15.596
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah!

00:02:15.596 --> 00:02:16.643
- God bless us all. So it was so much fun-

00:02:16.643 --> 00:02:19.670
- I Know, I always like to
remind myself, think of yourself

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:20.910
as that 10 year old kid.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:21.743
- That was just like-
- [Ken Jeong] Yes!

00:02:21.743 --> 00:02:23.370
- You know, remember that feeling.

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:24.600
- [Ken Jeong] Yes, yes!
- So yeah.

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:27.720
