Well just among friends,

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:32.317
it's become of the vernacular of

00:02:32.317 --> 00:02:33.150
"we're not worthy or what",

00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:34.170
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah, yeah!

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:36.180
all these things!
- Yeah!

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:39.930
And I remember one time, on
set, we're just joking around.

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:41.370
I was feeling more comfortable around 'em

