00:02:56.304 --> 00:02:57.137
(laughter)

00:02:57.137 --> 00:02:59.190
I was, if you haven't seen
his special, it's amazing.

00:02:59.190 --> 00:03:00.023
And it'll make you so happy-

00:03:00.023 --> 00:03:00.930
- Well, Kevin's a friend of mine.

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:02.996
So you walked in and it's
more like, "bop, bop, bop!

00:03:02.996 --> 00:03:03.829
(laughter)

00:03:03.829 --> 00:03:04.662
- I know! (laughs)

00:03:04.662 --> 00:03:09.210
