00:03:27.807 --> 00:03:28.640
- [Kelly Clarkson] Ah!

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:29.473
- [Ken Jeong] "thank you!"

00:03:29.473 --> 00:03:30.309
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yes!

00:03:30.309 --> 00:03:33.900
- But, right when the hangover came out,

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:35.850
I was at an ATM where I live

00:03:35.850 --> 00:03:40.410
and this dude is in a
convertible, just staring at me

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:42.510
and I'm getting money, just staring at me.

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:43.620
I'm getting money, just staring at me-

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:44.453
- Like, "Am I about to be robbed?"

00:03:44.453 --> 00:03:45.286
(laughter)

00:03:45.286 --> 00:03:46.119
