00:03:46.119 --> 00:03:49.980
And there was a stoplight,
it was red, it turned green.

00:03:49.980 --> 00:03:51.300
And as he goes through, he looks at me.

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:53.100
He goes "Too-da-loo, mother (beep)!"

00:03:53.958 --> 00:03:55.738
"Woo woo woo woo woo woo
woo woo woo woo woo woo!"

00:03:55.738 --> 00:03:59.178
(laughter)
(applause)

00:03:59.178 --> 00:04:00.258
