00:04:05.879 --> 00:04:06.712
I wouldn't even a part of it!

00:04:06.712 --> 00:04:07.545
- Oh, that's right!

00:04:07.545 --> 00:04:08.460
- [Kelly Clarkson] I
wasn't even a part of it!

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:09.330
People just yell my name

