00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:18.030
But yeah, it's a really cool
thing though, to be like

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:19.680
it's a big thing in pop culture.

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:20.552
It's huge!
- This is beyond

00:04:20.552 --> 00:04:25.552
a dream come true because
I was just 15 years ago.

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:28.890
