00:04:51.895 --> 00:04:54.360
- Which is horrible, but many
are still experiencing grief

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:57.570
due to social injustice and
loss due to the pandemic.

00:04:57.570 --> 00:04:59.190
So as someone in the medical field,

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:00.023
- Yeah.

00:05:00.023 --> 00:05:02.010
- stress and living in
a stressful environment

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:03.510
