00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:11.400
- It's just important to know that

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:13.260
we're all in this together.

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:15.840
I mean your actions affect our actions.

00:05:15.840 --> 00:05:17.490
Our actions affect your actions.

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:21.660
We are here together and
right now, thank God we're

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:24.060
