00:05:31.845 --> 00:05:32.910
(applause)

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:37.170
- To survive! And there is no one person

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:38.670
that is more important than the other.

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:41.280
We need each other to survive.
- No one's exempt from that.

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:42.438
- We need each other,

00:05:42.438 --> 00:05:43.271
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:05:43.271 --> 00:05:44.880
- and we can't do it without each other.

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:45.713
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:05:45.713 --> 00:05:47.280
- Again, it's a movement of us.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.680
It's a medical movement of us,
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:52.440
- as a globe to take care of each other.

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:55.500
We take care of ourselves. We
can take care of each other.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:56.333
- [Kelly Clarkson] Yeah.

00:05:56.333 --> 00:05:59.130
And as entertainers,
sometimes we're fortunate to

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:01.770
